
@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Create Order

start

:Receive OrderCreateRequest;
:Create PrintOrder;
:Set order status to PENDING;
:Set initial total price to 0;

:Prepare items for validation;
if (Promotion code provided?) then (Yes)
    :Prepare OrderPromotion;
else (No)
endif

:Create OrderValidationContext;
:Execute Order Validation Chain;

note right
Validation order:
1. ServiceAvailabilityHandler
2. FileTypeValidationHandler
3. QuantityValidationHandler
4. PromotionValidityHandler
end note

if (Validation passed?) then (Yes)
    :Save PrintOrder;

    while (More order items?) is (Yes)
        :Find print service and add-ons;
        :Calculate item price using PricingCalculator;
        :Set pageCount = 1;
        :Set copyCount = max(1, quantity);
        :Save PrintItem;
        :Save selected add-ons;
    endwhile (No)

    if (Promotion exists?) then (Yes)
        :Calculate promotion discount;
    else (No)
    endif

    :Calculate and save final order total;
    :Collect add-on IDs;
    :Convert order to OrderResponse;
    :Return OrderResponse;
else (No)
    :Raise validation error;
endif

stop
@enduml